# Copy of PIETOOLS_demos/cuadmm/.gitattributes: the suite's shell scripts moved
# here with testing_codes (MMP, 11/08/2026).
# The repo root sets `* text=auto` and core.autocrlf is true, so on a Windows
# checkout these would get CRLF endings and then fail under WSL bash with
# "$'\r': command not found". Keep shell scripts LF everywhere.
*.sh text eol=lf
